  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to Strengthen the Implementation of DOTS Activites in Sierra Leone - Sierra Leone (01-Nov-2013-31-Dec-2015)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The TB disease burden in Sierra Leone is high.  The program supported by this grant is scaling up interventions to ensure access to expanded services.  The program focuses on early detection, diagnosis and treatment of new sputum smear positive cases.  Interventions focus in particular on the integration of private practitioners and laboratories in urban centers and the inclusion of prisons and the military.</narrative>
  </description>
